{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794343934840,"sessionID":"ses_e38dce68fffekvhklwtw9VZA4b","part":{"id":"prt_1c73b9b58001zMZmyJDn5XwVfF","messageID":"msg_1c73acc0d001cFvn2X0CQW79Hp","sessionID":"ses_e38dce68fffekvhklwtw9VZA4b","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794343934840,"sessionID":"ses_e38dce68fffekvhklwtw9VZA4b","part":{"id":"prt_1c73b9b5e001U5x1l0qaIhr29e","messageID":"msg_1c73acc0d001cFvn2X0CQW79Hp","sessionID":"ses_e38dce68fffekvhklwtw9VZA4b","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build an image gallery app: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth, image upload/delete with base64 PNG/JPEG, SQLite storage in `./data`) plus a React+TypeScript+Vite+Tailwind frontend, both served by the backend on port 8000 from the root `Dockerfile`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack: Flask (Python 3.13), gunicorn, SQLite in `./data`; frontend Vite 8 + React 19 + Tailwind CSS v4 (`@tailwindcss/vite` plugin, entry `frontend/src/index.css` containing only `@import \"tailwindcss\";`).\n- Auth: `POST /api/auth/register` → 201; `POST /api/auth/login` → 200 `{\"token\"}`; requests send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 when missing/invalid.\n- Image format detected from magic bytes (PNG `\\x89PNG\\r\\n\\x1a\\n`, JPEG `\\xff\\xd8\\xff`), not filename; duplicate filenames are separate rows; only uploader may delete (403 otherwise).\n- Image object fields: `id`, `filename`, `title`, `content_type`, `size_bytes`, `uploaded_at`, `url`, `uploader` (username string); list returns `{\"items\", \"total\", \"page\", \"page_size\"}`, newest first, default `page_size=20`, max 100.\n- Status code decisions: upload → 201, delete → 204, duplicate username → 409, bad query ints → 400; errors are JSON `{\"error\": \"...\"}`.\n- Data dir resolved via `Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / \"data\"` (robust to cwd); files stored as `data/files/<uuid4hex>` with no extension.\n- Username uniqueness is `COLLATE NOCASE`; passwords hashed with `werkzeug.security`.\n- `backend/requirements.lock` was rewritten from hash-pinned to plain version pins (hashes in a constraints file triggered pip's `--require-hashes` mode and broke the Dockerfile's `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` under pip 25.1.1; plain pins verified working on pip 25.1.1 and 26.3).\n- Docker unavailable in sandbox; verification done by running gunicorn locally on 127.0.0.1:8000.\n- Sandbox rules: writes/bash to `/tmp/opencode/*` and other external dirs are denied; test files must live inside `/workspace` and be deleted afterwards.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `backend/app.py` fully implemented: health, register/login, list/get/create/delete images, file serving via `send_file(..., conditional=True)`, JSON 404/405/413 error handlers, `MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH` 32MB, SPA catch-all that returns JSON 404 for `api/*` paths, `init_db()` at import.\n- Frontend implemented: `src/api.ts` (fetch client, `ApiError`, session in localStorage key `gallery.session`, format helpers), `src/App.tsx` (session state, paging with PAGE_SIZE=12, notice banner, delete flow), components `AuthForms.tsx`, `UploadForm.tsx` (magic-byte client check, dataURL preview, API error display), `Gallery.tsx` (responsive grid + empty/loading/error states), `ImageDetail.tsx` (modal with filename/title/size/uploader/date, delete with `window.confirm`), `vite-env.d.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `index.css`, updated `vite.config.ts` (tailwind plugin), `main.tsx`, `index.html` title.\n- Deps added to `frontend/package.json` + lockfile: `tailwindcss@^4.3.5`, `@tailwindcss/vite@^4.3.5`, `typescript@^5.9.3`, `@types/react@^19.3.0`, `@types/react-dom@^19.3.0`; scripts `build: vite build`, `typecheck: tsc --noEmit`.\n- Verified: `npm ci`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run build` all pass; 50/50 API tests pass in `/workspace/.test_api.py`; persistence across gunicorn restart confirmed; frontend index + assets served with correct content types; pip constraint install verified for pip 25.1.1 and 26.3.\n- Edge-case checks passing: non-JSON body → 400 JSON, `/api/auth/login` GET → 404 JSON (405 handler exists but GET matches no route → 404), `/api/images/abc` → 404 JSON, public list unaffected by bogus auth header.\n\n### Active\n- Investigating the 413 (payload-too-large) path: a 33MB POST caused a client-side `BrokenPipeError` (server appears to close early), so it's unconfirmed whether Flask returns the JSON `{\"error\":\"request payload too large\"}` or an HTML error; gunicorn log showed no errors and server stays healthy.\n- Cleanup pending: remove `/workspace/.test_api.py`, `gunicorn.pid`, `gunicorn.log`, `data/`, `backend/__pycache__/`, and stop the running gunicorn daemon (pid in `/workspace/gunicorn.pid`).\n\n### Blocked\n- No Docker available (`docker: command not found`), so image build can only be inferred from locally passing `npm ci`/`npm run build`/pip install steps.\n- No headless browser (no chromium/playwright), so frontend is only verified by typecheck, build, and static checks.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Confirm 413 behavior (e.g. via `curl --data-binary` with a >32MB body) and ensure a JSON error body is returned; adjust `@app.errorhandler(413)` if needed.\n2. Re-run the full test suite once with fresh data, then clean up: kill gunicorn, delete `/workspace/.test_api.py`, `gunicorn.pid`, `gunicorn.log`, `data/`, `backend/__pycache__/`; optionally add a `.gitignore` for `data/`, `frontend/dist`, `frontend/node_modules`, `__pycache__`, `*.log`, `*.pid`.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: Flask app — auth, images API, SQLite schema, static/SPA serving.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`: `flask==3.1.3`, `gunicorn==26.2.0` (unchanged).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: plain version pins (modified; hashes removed to fix Dockerfile pip install).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: build contract — `npm ci` + `npm run build` in frontend stage, pip install with `-c requirements.lock`, gunicorn on port 8000.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: main UI orchestration (session, paging, delete, notices).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: API client, types, localStorage session, format helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/`: `AuthForms.tsx`, `UploadForm.tsx`, `Gallery.tsx`, `ImageDetail.tsx`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`: deps + scripts (`npm ci` must keep working).\n- `/workspace/.test_api.py`: 50-check end-to-end API test script (must be deleted before finishing).\n- `/workspace/frontend/dist/`: built frontend served by `backend/app.py` (`DIST` path).\n- `/workspace/data/`: runtime SQLite DB + stored files (created during tests; delete before finishing).","time":{"start":1794343934814,"end":1794343934817}}}
